{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"kdl","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"KDL","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for KDL (.kdl).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"kdl","name":"KDL","extensions":[".kdl"],"grammar":"grammars/kdl.json","lineComment":"//","blockComment":["/*","*/"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"KDL","path":"snippets/kdl.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/kdl.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"/-\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\/\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\/\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\([^)]*\\\\)\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[A-Za-z_][\\\\w.-]*(?==)\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^\\\\s*[A-Za-z_][\\\\w.-]*\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"r#*\\\"[^\\\"]*\\\"#*\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true|null)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/kdl.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Node\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"node\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:name} ${2:key}=\\\"${3:value}\\\"\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A node with a property\"\n  },\n  \"Node with children\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"nodec\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:name} {\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A node with children\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# KDL\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for KDL.\n\n## Files\n\n`.kdl`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `//`.\n- 2 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `node` | A node with a property |\n| `nodec` | A node with children |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}